  "name": {
    "zh-CN": "TCMCraft 社区中医诊所（虚构，新加坡）",
    "en": "TCMCraft Community TCM Clinic (fictional, Singapore)"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh-CN": "虚构的新加坡社区中医诊所，一层：入口候诊大厅（挂号台、自助问诊机）、三间中医诊室（含一间复诊与远程会诊室）、针灸推拿治疗室、中药房（发药窗口与限制进入的调剂区）和物品库房。附近有巴士站。",
    "en": "A fictional single-storey community TCM clinic in Singapore: an entrance waiting hall (registration and an intake kiosk), three TCM consulting rooms (one used for reviews and teleconsultation), an acupuncture and tuina room, the herbal dispensary (a collection counter and a restricted dispensing area) and a store. A bus stop is close by."
  },
